      "id": "6c5faf10f0e88069",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Current Projects - https://lexemancy.com/projects.html\n## _**🜂 ⇌ [ConSensus](https://github.com/SyntaxAsSpiral/zk-context-vault) **online** ⇌ 🜔**_\n\n## _**◈ ⇌ [Semantic JSON](https://github.com/SyntaxAsSpiral/semantic-json) **online** ⇌ ◇**_\n\n## _**🜎 ⇌ [Esoter👁️cons](https://github.com/SyntaxAsSpiral/esotericons) **online** ⇌ 🜏**_\n\n## _**🜍 ⇌ [Collectivist](https://github.com/SyntaxAsSpiral/collectivist) **online** ⇌ ⊕**_\n\n## _**🜏 ⇌ [Paneudaemonium](https://lexemancy.com/paneudaemonium/) **online** ⇌ 🜄**_\n\n## _**🜂 ⇌ [Codæx Pulseframe](https://github.com/SyntaxAsSpiral/codex-pulseframe) **online** ⇌ 🜔**_",
